{"body":"## Summary\nExtends the isolated visual-preview architecture to the Admin Workspace, matching the approved Claude Design export (\\mindmosaic-admin-workspace.html\\, artboards b0–b26).\n\n### Implemented Screens & Artboards\n- **Overview (b0, b1, b4)**: Editorial and governance dashboard with real-time metrics, sign-off queues, and activity feeds.\n- **Question Library (b2, b3)**: Comprehensive question registry (142 original items) with Year level, Subject, Status filters, and instant text search.\n- **Question Review (b5, b6, b7)**: In-depth item inspector with question prompt, deterministic SVG visual stimulus, multiple-choice options with answer secrecy compliance, distractor rationale, and ACARA alignment.\n- **Human Approval Gate (b8, b9, b10)**: Strict implementation of Standing Rule #8: mandatory human gate (\\^GpprovedBy\\) before publication. Demonstrates reviewer Maya Chen sign-off flow with zero database writes.\n- **Paper Review & Staging (b11, b12)**: Examination papers lineup, question count, and timed parameters.\n- **Publication & Tamper-Evident Ledger (b13, b14)**: Manifest ledger status, sha256 AST root hash, and fail-closed integrity validation.\n- **Writing Submissions Review (b15, b16, b17)**: Student essay submissions with 6-criteria Australian Curriculum rubric marking workflow.\n- **Parent Support Queue (b18, b19, b20)**: Support ticket triage and message inspect.\n- **Activity Log & Audit Ledger (b21, b22)**: Immutable event timeline.\n- **Governance Map (b23)**: End-to-end question factory lifecycle flow.\n\n### Preview Gate & Isolation\n- **Gate**: \\ADMIN_WORKSPACE_PREVIEW=1\\, loopback host only (\\localhost\\, \\127.0.0.1\\), \\!isSupabaseConfigured\\, not on Vercel.\n- **Zero Real Writes**: Approval sign-offs, ticket replies, and ledger validations execute in local React state only.\n- **Outside Preview**: Existing \\AdminShell\\ and role security (\\\requireRole('admin')\\) hold completely unchanged.\n\n### Verification Passed\n- \\\npm run typecheck\\: Passed (0 errors)\n- Vitest \\src/tests/pages/admin-preview-mode.test.tsx\\: Passed (10 tests)\n- \\\npx next build --webpack\\: Passed cleanly (compiled all 69 static & dynamic routes)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-11-09T11:19:00Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 5"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-09T11:19:00Z","messageBody":"…rds (b0–b26)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"feat(admin): implement visual preview mode for admin workspace artboa…","oid":"ba6c496e483ffcdc3ffa8ebe7d1e2ecc9a3bd0ee"},{"authoredDate":"2026-11-10T23:03:01Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-10T23:03:01Z","messageBody":"…and privacy boundaries","messageHeadline":"feat(admin): foundation navigation, responsive layout, state boards, …","oid":"aa17368a79cb2f908535d9d4fd72fcea82b12885"}],"files":[{"path":"docs/admin-workspace-discovery/INVENTORY.md","additions":54,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/admin-workspace-discovery/PHASE-A.md","additions":161,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/admin-workspace-discovery/evidence/all-artboards.json","additions":1100,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/admin-workspace-discovery/evidence/artboards-01.json","additions":493,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/admin-workspace-discovery/evidence/artboards-02.json","additions":309,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/admin-workspace-discovery/evidence/artboards-03.json","additions":302,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/admin-workspace-discovery/evidence/baseline.json","additions":13,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":